// W4d surface fold-in — operator-fixity declarations and the `rec` block.
//
// GRADUATION: both are reserved parse-and-decline. The operator-fixity form
// `op <fixity> <level> "spelling" ;` reuses the reserved `op` lead and a
// string-literal spelling (so the labeler needs no user-operator token); the
// actual per-module wiring is the `Pbg::extend` seam + wyrd-7xl7. The reserved
// mutual-recursion `rec { … }` block (ADR-57 D4) graduates under wyrd-u7m5.
// Parse-only; never lowered.

// Operator-fixity declarations (each fixity class parses).
op infixl 6 "<|>" ;
op infixr 5 "<>" ;
op prefix 9 "!" ;
op postfix 9 "?" ;

// The reserved mutual-recursion block: inline value / function defs.
rec { def f = g; def g = f; }
